# gemma4:e2b-it-qat-text — the same Ollama artifact with the projector layer dropped.
#
# WHY: the stock tag declares `vision` and `audio`, so the daemon passes --mmproj
# unconditionally and a vision+audio encoder is resident for a pure-text workload.
# MEASURED 2026-09-04 on the GTX 1650 Ti: 1154.07 MiB of a 4096 MiB card, 28% of
# the budget, and `ollama ps` does not count it.
#
# WHAT IS AND IS NOT CHANGED. This is `ollama show --modelfile gemma4:e2b-it-qat`
# with the second FROM removed and nothing else touched:
#
#   - The model blob is Ollama's OWN re-containered artifact, by digest. It is NOT
#     Google's Hub file. Slot 5 of the rig name and the provenance argument in
#     CLAUDE.md are therefore unaffected -- this is still what the daemon
#     packaged, minus a layer.
#   - RENDERER gemma4 / PARSER gemma4 are carried over verbatim, so the Go chat
#     renderer and the thinking parser are the same ones the stock tag uses.
#   - The three sampling parameters are carried over verbatim. Ollama's defaults
#     differ from llama-server's, and changing them would confound the A/B.
#
# The LICENSE block is dropped because it is not load-bearing; the license is
# unchanged and is on the original tag.
FROM /home/xbill/.ollama/models/blobs/sha256-3646b4c147cd235a44d91df1546d3b7d8e29b547dbe4e1f80856419aa455e6fd
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER temperature 1
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
